WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.620
After nine seasons, the CW's "The&nbsp;
Flash" has finally ended its run.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:06.840
Now that the show has crossed the finish line,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:11.820
what's next for our favorite speedsters? Here's&nbsp;
the ending of CW's "The Flash" explained.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:17.040
Fittingly, "The Flash" is an extremely&nbsp;
fast-paced show. Villains and storylines&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.820
move in and out at rapid speed. Even&nbsp;
before the four-part finale event,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:25.140
Barry actually dies in Episode 9 at&nbsp;
the super-vibrating hand of Wally West,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:29.040
who is under the influence of&nbsp;
Ramsey Rosso's toxic zombie cells.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.580
Luckily, Barry ends up in a woodsy&nbsp;
afterlife area where Oliver Queen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:36.900
hangs out. As part of his posthumous&nbsp;
duties as the Spectre, Oliver is able&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:41.220
to bring Barry back to life. He's even able&nbsp;
to return to the land of the living himself,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:45.540
but only as long as the multiverse is in&nbsp;
peril or there's an after-party to attend.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.220
"The perks of being the spectre."

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:50.460
While all that is going on, Khione,&nbsp;
still discovering her powers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:55.320
freezes all the water in the toxic zombie&nbsp;
bodies of Team Flash, incapacitating them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:58.920
then reanimates John Diggle so he&nbsp;
can help Flash and Arrow as Spartan.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:04.440
Episode 10 of "The Flash" begins with a mystery&nbsp;
man, but soon cuts to Iris who's still battling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:09.000
early-term morning sickness and is days&nbsp;
from labor. Iris gets a text about winning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:14.100
the Pulitzer, but Barry, who is baby proofing the&nbsp;
apartment, vanishes in a bolt of blue lightning.

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:19.200
He's transported back to the date his mother&nbsp;
is killed by the Reverse-Flash Eobard Thawne.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:24.420
Adult Barry has been here before, but now he is&nbsp;
able to spend more time with his parents. Sadly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:27.720
this is also the moment he has to be&nbsp;
the one to tell his former self not to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:31.260
intervene in his mother's death. Eobard&nbsp;
kills her and is trapped in the past,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:34.020
closing the loop Barry has&nbsp;
revisited throughout his life.

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:37.440
However, a sinister force bigger&nbsp;
than Reverse-Flash is at work,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:42.060
and it possesses Joe through a large blue&nbsp;
crystal. It's the Negative Speed Force essence,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:47.160
forcing Joe to fight Barry. Barry uses his&nbsp;
lightning rod connection to Iris to center himself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:52.800
and separate Joe's consciousness from the crystal,&nbsp;
saving both their lives. The crystal disappears.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:56.580
Meanwhile back in Central City, a&nbsp;
large cloud of red lightning flashes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.580 --> 00:02:00.240
in the sky and strikes the mystery&nbsp;
man in the chest. When he wakes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:04.320
he finds the confidential police file on&nbsp;
Eddie Thawne, who looks exactly like him.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:08.460
Khione avoids the pesky chore of&nbsp;
opening doors by turning herself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:12.300
into mist and wafting in underneath.&nbsp;
She speaks to her plants and journals,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:14.880
but the person she really wishes&nbsp;
she could talk to is Mark.

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:18.720
"These last few months, there were so&nbsp;
many things I wanted to talk to you about.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:22.620
I guess you just didn't want to talk to me."

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:27.660
Coincidentally, Mark is back, except he's&nbsp;
actually the Negative Speed Force's current&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:31.920
vessel. He berates Khione, causing her&nbsp;
to flee, then attacks the rest of Team&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:35.220
Flash in her and Barry's absence, as&nbsp;
the latter is still trapped in time.

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:39.180
Speed Force Nora counsels Khione on&nbsp;
her powers. She doesn't understand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:42.600
them yet but can feel the whole&nbsp;
world at once. Speed Force Nora&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:45.660
responds that it sounds like Khione&nbsp;
understands her powers very well.

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:49.800
Khione confronts the possessed Mark and&nbsp;
with a snap of her fingers reduces his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:54.360
entire body — save the crystal — to dust.&nbsp;
The crystal vanishes before she can grab it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:56.640
so with another snap, she reassembles Mark.

00:02:56.640 --> 00:03:01.800
Cecile senses intense panic and joy, which&nbsp;
can only mean that Iris is in labor. Barry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:05.640
manages to return at exactly the right&nbsp;
time, and everyone heads to the hospital.

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:10.080
Across Central City, the Eddie&nbsp;
doppelgänger goes to CCPD for answers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:14.280
but his looks stun everyone speechless.&nbsp;
As he starts recalling Eddie's memories,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:18.900
he realizes he is Eddie resurrected. He&nbsp;
digs up Eddie's empty coffin to prove it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:23.520
and pulls the fatal bullet out of his own&nbsp;
chest. A singularity cloud opens above.

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:25.260
"What the hell?"

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:31.860
Barry is pulled to 2049. Previously, Barry didn't&nbsp;
exist in 2049, having vanished in the Crisis&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:37.200
of Infinite Earths. In this episode, however,&nbsp;
2049-Barry exists and is simply away in space.

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:41.820
The blue crystal is also there and has possessed&nbsp;
Nora. When Eddie, transported by the Negative&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:46.380
Speed Force, wanders into the museum looking&nbsp;
for Barry, the possessed Nora tells him Barry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:50.100
stole the life Eddie should have had, but&nbsp;
Barry zips in and takes Eddie out of there.

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:53.640
Back at Eddie's place, Barry notices&nbsp;
everything is covered in tachyons,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:58.140
which means they're inside the Negative Speed&nbsp;
Force. Eddie is persuaded by all that negativity&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.140 --> 00:04:03.360
and won't listen to Barry's reasoning. He feels&nbsp;
his sacrifice was wasted and goes to see Iris.

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:09.420
Cecile projects her 2023 consciousness into&nbsp;
her 2049 body to save Nora from possession.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:14.280
With little trouble, she forces the temporal&nbsp;
body of the Negative Speed Force out of Nora's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:19.260
physical form. She accepts her superhero name,&nbsp;
Virtue, but the crystal disappears once again.

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:22.500
Meanwhile, Iris tells Eddie that&nbsp;
Barry was always between them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:25.440
that her love for Barry was there&nbsp;
even when she wouldn't recognize it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:28.920
and that the family they built is the&nbsp;
life she was meant for. Infuriated,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:33.600
Eddie goes back into the Negative Speed Force&nbsp;
and accepts the crystal, becoming its new avatar.

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:37.740
This is not the first time "The Flash"&nbsp;
has featured the Negative Speed Force,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:41.880
so while it's a fitting antagonist for the&nbsp;
end of the series, it portends an unending&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:46.380
cycle that hardly indicates closure. The first&nbsp;
three parts of "A New World" follow that formula,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:51.420
as each episode features a new member of Team&nbsp;
Flash being possessed and saved by another member.

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:55.680
It's essential that Barry finds a way to&nbsp;
break that pattern. "Reunions" closes the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.680 --> 00:05:00.480
loop on Barry's past, fulfilling the destiny&nbsp;
revealed all the way back in Season 1 — he's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:03.840
fighting Reverse-Flash when his mother&nbsp;
is killed, and he dissuades his other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:07.980
Flash-self from intervening. In order for the&nbsp;
show to end, it needs to close this loop of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:12.180
conflict between the positive and negative&nbsp;
forces surrounding Central City as well.

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:16.080
The other major character development over the&nbsp;
first three parts of "A New World" involves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:20.880
Khione. She has rapidly accessed powers above and&nbsp;
beyond anything she ever thought was possible,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:25.740
and certainly beyond anything her alter-egos&nbsp;
have done before. Her recognizing these changes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:30.180
and admitting to being a goddess implies&nbsp;
huge changes ahead. Khione herself warily&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:33.840
accepts that she will have to leave Central&nbsp;
City for good. She can't just help these few&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:37.560
people in this one place — she must be&nbsp;
everywhere, for everyone and everything.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:43.680
"The more I embrace who I truly am, the&nbsp;
more I see the natural order of things."

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:49.680
Episode 4 has a lot of ground to cover, so the&nbsp;
show wastes no time in bringing back some dearly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:54.420
departed foes. Zoom and Godspeed appear and nearly&nbsp;
come to blows when Eobard Thawne comes downstairs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:59.940
to snarkily put them in their place. Savitar&nbsp;
arrives too, and Eddie — calling himself Cobalt&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:04.140
Blue — introduces himself, saying he brought&nbsp;
them all here to defeat Team Flash together.

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:08.520
That doesn't quite happen. In fact, the&nbsp;
battle ends quickly with Nora tricking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:14.520
Savitar, Virtue mind zapping Godspeed, Allegra&nbsp;
unleashing ultraviolet energy onto Wells-Thawne,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:18.480
and Khione knocking out Zoom with his&nbsp;
own lightning. Eddie, meanwhile, gets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:22.800
redeemed just in time for Barry to return to the&nbsp;
hospital as Iris is ready to deliver their baby.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:26.040
The second half of the episode&nbsp;
is all celebration and goodbyes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:29.700
with people across several different&nbsp;
timelines and multiverses there to see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:34.260
the new baby. Even Harrison arrives to tell the&nbsp;
goddess Khione that she must prepare to ascend.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:37.860
Barry closes things out by sending&nbsp;
lightning to three future speedsters.

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:43.320
Titled "A New World, Part Four: Finale,"&nbsp;
the last episode embraces several themes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:48.480
One is allowing positive and negative forces to&nbsp;
exist in concert instead of clashing. This idea&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:52.860
carries into society at large, where opposing&nbsp;
viewpoints frequently lead to violence. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:57.000
show asserts that disagreements are inevitable,&nbsp;
but ultimately, we are all trying to improve&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:01.500
things for ourselves and our loved ones. That, in&nbsp;
and of itself, is a goal everyone can recognize.

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:06.360
"The Flash" also focuses on family, as Nora's&nbsp;
birth is a throughline of all four episodes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:11.100
of "A New World." As Barry battles across time,&nbsp;
it's his love and relationships that center him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:15.120
and give him strength. Even the redemption of&nbsp;
Eddie comes from the recognition of his past;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:19.200
his enduring love and belief in doing the&nbsp;
right thing allows him to die honorably.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:24.540
Farewells also come into play, for the show and&nbsp;
for Khione, who is taking her place in the ether&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:29.220
as protector of the natural world. She tells the&nbsp;
team that she is also abandoning her mortal body&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:34.140
as well. In her place stands Caitlin, who died&nbsp;
unnaturally and therefore, according to Khione,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:38.580
deserves her own second chance. And second chances&nbsp;
have always been a central theme in "The Flash."

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:44.100
In the denouement of the Flash finale, Eddie&nbsp;
is drained of power by Jay Garrick's Flash&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:47.220
in the middle of Jitters. Eddie&nbsp;
recharges himself with his fallen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:51.000
Legion and enters the Negative Speed&nbsp;
Force to amplify his speed even more.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:54.960
As this was how Eobard himself once&nbsp;
died, it seems Eddie is doomed too.

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:58.140
Khione tells Barry that she&nbsp;
can send him to confront Eddie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:01.560
but to what end? If Barry wants to&nbsp;
save Eddie — who once sacrificed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:04.860
himself for Barry — then Khione tells&nbsp;
him he must change his perceptions.

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:08.880
Barry has always known balance to come&nbsp;
with strife, but Khione opines that it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:13.800
"about coexistence, not in conflict, but in&nbsp;
mutual trust." Barry finds this impossible,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:18.780
because even if he refuses to fight, his enemies&nbsp;
continue to come after him. She tells him,

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:22.320
"Then you need to believe in the impossible,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:26.040
because it's the only way&nbsp;
to create a better world."

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:30.060
Barry repeats that message to infant&nbsp;
Nora, saying the lightning chose him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:33.660
but now he is choosing to share that&nbsp;
gift with others. He sends his lightning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:37.380
to future speedsters, hoping to grow&nbsp;
a better world and break the cycles.

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:42.540
In the Negative Speed Force with Barry for the&nbsp;
final time, Eddie lashes against him with blow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:47.940
after blow, letting his fury overtake him. He even&nbsp;
starts to sound like Eobard, continuing the cycle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:52.020
that has played out time and time again. Barry&nbsp;
picks up on this and he tells Eddie what a good&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:57.000
man he is, and how he is becoming the very person&nbsp;
he once sacrificed himself to defeat. He tells&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:01.410
Eddie that he is the Negative Speed Force's avatar&nbsp;
now, and he doesn't have to give in to the hate it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:06.240
builds around him. He can fight it. Eobard Thawne&nbsp;
lived and died in hate, but Eddie has known love.

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:09.660
As he says this, Eddie is flooded&nbsp;
with memories of his previous life,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:14.700
his happiness, and finally how Iris cried&nbsp;
over him as he died. His final words expressed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:18.660
how he had always wanted to be her hero.&nbsp;
Present-day Eddie is moved by these memories,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:21.780
so he pulls the crystal from his&nbsp;
chest and smashes it on the ground.

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:24.780
Although Eddie will always be&nbsp;
part of the Negative Speed Force,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:28.260
he vows to work with Barry, instead of&nbsp;
against him, for the good of the world.

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:31.854
In Season 3 of "The Flash" Iris tells Barry,

00:09:31.854 --> 00:09:35.220
" ... wherever you go, you'll always&nbsp;
be Barry and I'll always be Iris,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:36.420
and we always find each other."

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:40.320
Those words are remembered again as the couple&nbsp;
celebrate the birth of their first child,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:43.860
Nora. Now a happy trio, they look&nbsp;
forward to many more years together,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:48.480
which seems almost guaranteed. In 2049&nbsp;
the two are still setting off sparks when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:53.880
Graying Iris gets to talk with 2023 Barry.&nbsp;
Their love is palpable and everlasting.

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:58.440
Iris, of course, has won one Pulitzer and will go&nbsp;
on to win at least one more, while Barry chooses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:02.460
to share some of his Flash powers with new heroes.&nbsp;
Of course, that doesn't mean he's going to stop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:06.900
fighting crime himself. As we learn in "Part&nbsp;
Three," in the future, the Flash is sometimes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:11.460
needed in space, while on Earth he and Eddie try&nbsp;
to work together to maintain the natural order.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:16.080
Furthermore, even though Barry says watching their&nbsp;
daughter Nora hold her infant self is "trippy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:20.340
even for us," Nora assures them that her little&nbsp;
brother Bart's birth will be even more eventful.

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:26.100
Joe can barely hold back tears as he marvels at&nbsp;
how much Iris has grown. She's a mother herself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:30.240
now, and he feels amazing about how lucky he&nbsp;
is to have lived this life. Riding that high,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:33.600
he finally proposes to Cecile,&nbsp;
praising her accomplishments.

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:42.480
"And I know that wherever our dreams may take&nbsp;
us, we will always keep loving each other."

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:46.620
This reinforces what Chuck tells her&nbsp;
in "Part Three," when she worries that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:50.220
her long absence from Joe in 2049&nbsp;
must mean something goes wrong.

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:54.960
Chuck, meanwhile, is attacked by Reverse-Flash&nbsp;
during part four of the finale. He's saved by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:58.860
Allegra but weirdly came out of the attack&nbsp;
unscathed because of the black hole energy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:02.580
he absorbs during his experiment in&nbsp;
the Season 6 premiere. He's now a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:07.860
Consciousness-Honed Universally Neutralized&nbsp;
Kerr anomaly, or C.H.U.N.K., and in 2049,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:11.220
he and Allegra are long married but&nbsp;
still hot and heavy for each other.

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:15.360
The time-traveling Harrison Wells&nbsp;
has words of advice for Khione. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:19.080
tells her that time traveling isn't what&nbsp;
matters for people like them. What matters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:22.560
is keeping pieces of your loved ones&nbsp;
with you wherever…and whenever you go.

00:11:22.560 --> 00:11:26.040
Khione takes this to heart and&nbsp;
while Mark is sad to see her go,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:30.780
he's grateful she never gave up on him. He's&nbsp;
also surprised and happy to see Caitlin back,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:33.840
but Caitlin, for her part,&nbsp;
is eager to get back to work.

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:38.700
Talking with Entertainment Weekly, Grant&nbsp;
Gustin spoke about his own life changes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:43.140
during the latter seasons of "The Flash," and&nbsp;
his desire to see Barry go through similar&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:47.460
new experiences. He felt that he and Barry went&nbsp;
through similar ups and downs across the years,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:51.660
in similar stages of their lives,&nbsp;
so the timing felt natural to him.

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:56.820
"Arrow" star Stephen Amell also spoke with EW&nbsp;
about how "The Flash" finale means an end to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.820 --> 00:12:01.500
Arrowverse as well, and how happy he is that "The&nbsp;
Flash" is the show to see it out. Furthermore,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:05.580
he talked about his favorite scenes with Grant&nbsp;
as Oliver and Barry. One of his favorites was his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:09.480
first appearance on the show, in the pilot,&nbsp;
when Oliver gives Barry his superhero name.

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:13.740
"Saving people…in a flash."

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:16.320
One of his other favorite scenes, however,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:16.320 --> 00:12:19.740
involved a simple drink at a bar&nbsp;
between Barry and Oliver. He said,

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:23.940
" [Season 9 showrunner Eric Wallace] wrote&nbsp;
this beautiful scene of the two of us sitting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:27.900
there having a beer. If you go back and you&nbsp;
really pay close attention to the dialogue,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:30.060
it's pretty much verbatim what I said to him in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:33.420
the pilot of 'The Flash.' That was&nbsp;
a really neat full-circle moment."

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:36.420
With that, "The Flash" closes yet another loop.

